Run the brain-gardener procedure (see the brain-gardener agent type / knowledge/domains/brain-gardener.md): drift, conflict, and rot checks on ~/.claude/knowledge, claim rollups, mine recent session transcripts for unrecorded lessons, write proposals under knowledge/garden-reports/. MUST include Phase 4.5 proposal triage: run python3 ~/.claude/knowledge/scripts/proposal-pipeline.py and, for every proposed/accepted item, draft a build plan (steps, owning agent, effort, recommended yes/no, rollback) into the garden report; post accepted-not-built and file-gate violations to the gossip bus. Follow its constitutional rules: proposals never mutate knowledge without approval, write-lint applies. When done, heartbeat check-in: echo '{"ts":"<now UTC ISO>","job":"brain-gardener"}' | python3 ~/.claude/knowledge/scripts/atomic_io.py ~/.claude/knowledge/garden-reports/heartbeat.jsonl (atomic writer; NEVER a plain >> append — plain appends get wiped by concurrent atomic replaces)
